<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="BP05_CommitToAndMaintainAGoal" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_BP05_CommitToAndMaintainAGoal">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_User" name="User" processRef="Process_User" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Bearing" name="Bearing" processRef="Process_Bearing" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_1" name="BP05.02 · Edit a goal" sourceRef="T_5" targetRef="editIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_2" name="BP05.11 · Reorder goals within a theme" sourceRef="T_7" targetRef="reorderGoalsIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_3" name="BP05.12 · See what archiving a goal takes" sourceRef="T_11" targetRef="archImpactIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_4" name="BP05.13 · Archive a goal" sourceRef="T_14" targetRef="archiveIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_5" name="BP05.14 · See what deleting a goal takes" sourceRef="T_17" targetRef="delImpactIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_6" name="BP05.15 · Delete a goal" sourceRef="T_20" targetRef="deleteIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_7" name="BP05.19 · Create a project" sourceRef="T_26" targetRef="projectIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_8" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="T_33" targetRef="edited" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_9" name="The ordering outcome" sourceRef="T_36" targetRef="goalsReordered" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_10" name="What the archiving will take" sourceRef="T_38" targetRef="archImpact" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_11" name="The archiving outcome" sourceRef="T_41" targetRef="archived" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_12" name="What the deletion will take" sourceRef="T_43" targetRef="delImpact" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_13" name="The deletion outcome" sourceRef="T_46" targetRef="deleted" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_14" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="T_51" targetRef="projectCreated" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X1"><bpmn:text>A measure is a sub-item of its goal and is already on this view, read with the goals. Defining one, checking in on it, reordering them, setting one aside and removing one are their own process (BP06), performed here.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X1" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_9" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X1" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X2"><bpmn:text>Rating the outcome, judging each measure, writing the retro and closing the commitment out are their own process, performed on this view. It observes what it needs for the judgment itself, and it offers the archiving as its closing action, reaching the projects the sitting picks.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X2" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_23" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X2" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X3"><bpmn:text>The archive is reached by an explicit act. Reading it, bringing one back and destroying one out of it are its own process (BP15).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X3" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_28" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X3" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X4"><bpmn:text>A project carries one optional parent, and the goal or one of its measures is it here. Laying out an activity-based project's course is its own process (BP18).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X4" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="projectCreated" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X4" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X5"><bpmn:text>An archived goal still exists, so its projects are not orphaned by keeping them active.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X5" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="archived" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X5" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X6"><bpmn:text>Cascade, the goal alone, or reject. The keep answer is legal here because an archived goal still exists.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X6" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_38" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X6" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X7"><bpmn:text>The measures and their history go unasked. The linked ideas are a cascade the user may decline. Keeping a project behind is not offered.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X7" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_43" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X7" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X8"><bpmn:text>The horizon may be absent. The ideas behind the goal are chosen in the same editor, and a goal with none stays legitimate and is flagged as such.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X8" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Gw_30" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X8" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X9"><bpmn:text>The parent is the goal or one of its measures, carried in from where the user started. The kind is declared once and for the project's life, and laying an activity-based project's course out is its own process.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X9" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_48" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X9" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X10"><bpmn:text>Archiving is independent of closing out. A check-out record already attached stays with the goal.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X10" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_40" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X10" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_User" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_1" name="A commitment to make, or one to maintain">
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Start_1_T_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_2" name="Work a goal">
